            "repere": "Paragraphe · You're not alone. Acne is a serious sk…",
            "text": "You're not alone. Acne is a serious skin disease affecting 80% of young adults. 42.5% continue to suffer into their 20s and 30s. Not to alarm you, but acne can cause permanent scarring if left untreated. Together with decreased self-esteem, loneliness, depression and anxiety. Our formulas are developed over years to help you overcome acne.",
